1
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:19,140
This is disgusting.

2
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,620
I'll destroy everything.

3
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:26,220
Only two minutes left.

4
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:28,260
The final attack has begun.

5
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:33,350
Alright, in this counterattack
I want to finish the game decisively.

6
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:36,190
What is the most effective path?

7
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:39,440
Which one will I choose?

8
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:44,240
What? (Rin)!

9
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:47,480
He's charging in hard.

10
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:48,640
(Rin)!

11
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:51,130
Damn.

12
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:55,050
What revenge? What rivalry?

13
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:57,570
What brotherhood?

14
00:00:58,490 --> 00:01:01,660
Everything that holds me back is utterly disgusting.

15
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:08,180
I'll kill you all.

16
00:01:11,670 --> 00:01:14,910
"Episode 38
The Final Strike"

17
00:01:18,430 --> 00:01:20,400
Let's go, Rin!
Use the team play.

18
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,600
Out wide! This is a counterattack.

19
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,080
Why are you choosing the narrow side?

20
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,010
Did you come on purpose?

21
00:01:29,330 --> 00:01:31,490
Your tongue's hanging out, you have bad manners.

22
00:01:32,010 --> 00:01:33,490
Die, dwarf.

23
00:01:34,210 --> 00:01:37,130
Your weapon is speed.

24
00:01:37,930 --> 00:01:39,940
Let me exploit your acceleration.

25
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:43,180
With a reverse acceleration...

26
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:45,260
I'll destroy you.

27
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:49,070
What? Can this guy really
face off directly like this?

28
00:01:49,630 --> 00:01:50,790
This is madness!

29
00:01:51,270 --> 00:01:55,390
This is not the Rin we know at all.
His moves are completely illogical.

30
00:01:56,030 --> 00:01:57,430
What is he planning to do?

31
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:01,880
What's your deal? Am I next?

32
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:05,760
I'll kill everyone,
you tattooed baldy.

33
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:08,440
Your weapon is sneaking from behind.

34
00:02:09,090 --> 00:02:11,290
So I'll get on your level...

35
00:02:12,330 --> 00:02:14,530
...and grab what's behind you and finish you off.

36
00:02:14,930 --> 00:02:19,460
This kid, is he trying to use my own style
against me and destroy me head-on?

37
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:22,340
What an arrogant and greedy style!

38
00:02:22,980 --> 00:02:24,060
He's intersecting with him.

39
00:02:24,180 --> 00:02:26,900
- He'll be able to get past him at that point.
- I won't allow it.

40
00:02:27,140 --> 00:02:29,190
You can't easily get past what's behind me.

41
00:02:31,670 --> 00:02:33,950
A hand movement that blocks my turn.

42
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:36,870
And from this position,
he receives the ball with his heel.

43
00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:40,800
The second target has been completely destroyed.

44
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,560
Try to get past me, you bastard!

45
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:45,040
I'll take on any fight you throw at me.

46
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,400
The third target.

47
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:49,170
A fool who relies on his physical strength
and body pressure.

48
00:02:49,410 --> 00:02:51,850
Relying mainly on his core muscles
as the main engine.

49
00:02:52,290 --> 00:02:54,610
I'll kill you, I'll finish you off.

50
00:02:54,930 --> 00:02:58,980
I'll lure you into the pressing duel
that you're good at, then I'll throw the bait.

51
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:02,780
That bastard kicked the ball on purpose.

52
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:07,140
But his little tricks are worthless
against my physique.

53
00:03:07,540 --> 00:03:09,550
Doberman Charge!

54
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:14,910
You're full of yourself, bow down, old man.

55
00:03:15,950 --> 00:03:18,470
Full center-of-gravity charge.

56
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:24,720
That bastard used the power of my charge
to crush me from a low point.

57
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,840
Oh God! No whistle!

58
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:29,090
On the edge of a foul!

59
00:03:29,170 --> 00:03:33,250
Player Rin advances,
breaking through the opponent's iron defense all alone.

60
00:03:33,810 --> 00:03:34,890
Oh my God!

61
00:03:35,210 --> 00:03:36,370
Is this really Rin?

62
00:03:37,370 --> 00:03:43,100
A playing style that draws out the opponent's
strongest weapons and completely shatters them.

63
00:03:44,500 --> 00:03:48,220
Is this your flow, Rin Itoshi?

64
00:03:49,230 --> 00:03:51,230
This is madness!

65
00:03:52,550 --> 00:03:54,630
This is not the Rin I know.

66
00:03:57,590 --> 00:04:01,000
It seems to be the opposite of Sae Itoshi's style,
the beautiful destruction.

67
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:06,520
He forces the opponent to show their best,
then destroys them.

68
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,290
Is this your ego?

69
00:04:09,650 --> 00:04:13,490
What a bizarre nature,
little genius brother!

70
00:04:14,130 --> 00:04:15,730
One target left.

71
00:04:16,890 --> 00:04:18,570
Crush everything.

72
00:04:20,060 --> 00:04:22,740
Destroy everything that holds me back.

73
00:04:23,340 --> 00:04:24,340
Kill them.

74
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:27,540
I'll be reborn with this goal.

75
00:04:28,020 --> 00:04:29,190
Only one left.

76
00:04:29,550 --> 00:04:32,510
I'll kill him, I'll destroy him, I'll finish him.

77
00:04:33,150 --> 00:04:35,230
The distance to the goal is more than twenty meters.

78
00:04:35,910 --> 00:04:37,590
If he gets past me, it's over.

79
00:04:38,190 --> 00:04:40,200
Best to buy time here.

80
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:43,200
The final defensive line is extremely tough.

81
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:47,040
Update the data inside me.

82
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,530
Reverse acceleration.

83
00:04:50,010 --> 00:04:51,330
Closing the back spaces.

84
00:04:51,690 --> 00:04:53,210
And disrupting the center of gravity.

85
00:04:54,250 --> 00:04:57,090
He has clearly evolved,
not just one step, but several steps.

86
00:04:57,570 --> 00:05:00,860
He changed his playing style
to a very offensive and aggressive one.

87
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:03,620
This is exciting, Rin Itoshi.

88
00:05:04,060 --> 00:05:06,060
Try to surpass everything I have.

89
00:05:14,870 --> 00:05:15,910
Really!

90
00:05:17,390 --> 00:05:19,400
Even I can't win.

91
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:22,600
This is amazing, tongue-out Rin.

92
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:26,640
That ego of yours made my love cells
jump like crazy.

93
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:29,970
But I won't let you
become the hero of this match.

94
00:05:30,170 --> 00:05:31,690
Shidou! This is incredible!

95
00:05:32,570 --> 00:05:35,570
The situation is changing and the possibilities are being redefined.

96
00:05:36,970 --> 00:05:38,570
Should I wait? No.

97
00:05:38,820 --> 00:05:40,660
If I miss this moment, we'll fade away.

98
00:05:41,060 --> 00:05:44,460
- This moment is enough to bet on fate.
- "All-in bet."

99
00:05:45,460 --> 00:05:46,740
Double press.

100
00:05:48,380 --> 00:05:50,870
Rin, feel me! Look at me!

101
00:05:51,590 --> 00:05:52,750
That simple man.

102
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:55,110
This is bad, if he passes the ball now.

103
00:05:57,830 --> 00:05:59,960
Don't limit my possibilities.

104
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:03,360
Stop sticking to me, you bastard Isagi.

105
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:07,520
I'll smash you, I'll kill you.

106
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,850
Will he shoot from that spot?

107
00:06:10,010 --> 00:06:11,490
From here, Rin.

108
00:06:11,570 --> 00:06:15,130
The annoyance of number 11 adds a new dimension to him.

109
00:06:15,770 --> 00:06:19,380
But if I control the danger zone...

110
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:23,340
Shot feint!

111
00:06:25,580 --> 00:06:26,700
Not yet.

112
00:06:27,100 --> 00:06:28,830
I can't break now.

113
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:31,190
I'll destroy everything.

114
00:06:32,110 --> 00:06:33,430
Everything without exception.

115
00:06:34,150 --> 00:06:35,630
Try to destroy me...

116
00:06:35,990 --> 00:06:39,800
If you truly are the forward
who will change this country's future.

117
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:41,640
Launch it.

118
00:07:07,940 --> 00:07:09,790
You're still weak.

119
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:26,640
"Three goals to three.
Friendly match."

120
00:07:31,250 --> 00:07:33,650
"Extra Time"

121
00:07:34,930 --> 00:07:37,970
One minute of extra time.
Ball in possession of Sae Itoshi.

122
00:07:38,050 --> 00:07:39,500
We are in the final moments of the match.

123
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:40,900
Will this be the last play?

124
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:43,660
This will definitely be amazing.

125
00:07:44,580 --> 00:07:45,620
Really.

126
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:47,420
- Here he comes.
- The last attack.

127
00:07:47,500 --> 00:07:49,390
- Fall back, Blue Lock.
- Stop them, stop them.

128
00:07:49,470 --> 00:07:50,750
- Run.
- Run.

129
00:07:50,830 --> 00:07:52,830
Defend even if it costs you your life.

130
00:07:53,230 --> 00:07:55,870
If I steal the ball, it'll be a huge chance.

131
00:07:57,510 --> 00:07:58,880
It's not over yet.

132
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:05,680
No, I'm here.

133
00:08:09,170 --> 00:08:10,370
Damn it.

134
00:08:10,610 --> 00:08:13,610
Don't rush in recklessly, you idiots.
I'll buy us time.

135
00:08:13,890 --> 00:08:16,890
We're outnumbered.
Cover the free man.

136
00:08:17,170 --> 00:08:19,100
If they score now, it's the end.

137
00:08:19,260 --> 00:08:20,900
Hold on, you fools.

138
00:08:21,020 --> 00:08:22,220
Got it.

139
00:08:34,790 --> 00:08:37,830
I'll kill, I'll destroy, I'll smash.

140
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:45,640
Not scoring just now
is proof of your limited abilities.

141
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:49,890
Shut up, you arrogant bastard brother.

142
00:08:50,930 --> 00:08:52,530
Who do you think you are?

143
00:08:54,050 --> 00:08:56,370
If you'd stayed quietly isolated at home...

144
00:08:56,610 --> 00:08:58,780
You would have died without knowing your place.

145
00:08:59,580 --> 00:09:03,540
Showing up here like this
is the consequence of your own doing.

146
00:09:03,740 --> 00:09:04,900
Enough blabbering.

147
00:09:05,420 --> 00:09:07,580
I won't fall into your trap, you nasty brother.

148
00:09:08,910 --> 00:09:10,910
Haven't you understood yet, Rin?

149
00:09:11,790 --> 00:09:13,990
You will not become the best in the world.

150
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:16,150
Stop! That's enough!

151
00:09:16,510 --> 00:09:20,000
You can't even play football
without me being the reason for it.

152
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:23,160
You're just a little brother living in my shadow.

153
00:09:28,730 --> 00:09:30,170
How weak you are!

154
00:09:31,010 --> 00:09:34,490
Don't you dare use me as an excuse
to play football again.

155
00:09:37,370 --> 00:09:40,140
That bastard's words
when he told me back then...

156
00:09:41,140 --> 00:09:43,500
I feel like I finally understand their meaning now.

157
00:09:45,740 --> 00:09:46,980
How weak you are!

158
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:49,550
This is disgusting.

159
00:09:51,510 --> 00:09:53,510
What I must destroy...

160
00:09:55,430 --> 00:09:56,550
Is my own self.

161
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,920
The little genius brother.

162
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,760
The rival partner.

163
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:13,050
Don't defile my life with your values
that suit only yourselves.

164
00:10:14,210 --> 00:10:17,610
I'm not just some thing in your lives.

165
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:21,180
I no longer want to be...

166
00:10:23,100 --> 00:10:24,580
Sae Itoshi's brother anymore.

167
00:10:26,940 --> 00:10:29,190
You have to trust this anger of yours.

168
00:10:30,470 --> 00:10:32,470
Surrender to your desire to destroy.

169
00:10:33,990 --> 00:10:35,030
I...

170
00:10:35,790 --> 00:10:36,790
It's me.

171
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,920
I am the egoist...

172
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:47,240
Rin Itoshi.

173
00:10:49,250 --> 00:10:52,050
You're amazing, Rin.
Play football with me.

174
00:10:54,930 --> 00:10:56,090
What's wrong with you?

175
00:10:57,090 --> 00:10:59,580
You can still show that face,
can't you?

176
00:11:09,310 --> 00:11:11,590
Go!

177
00:11:12,590 --> 00:11:13,870
"The Final Confrontation"

178
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:19,720
Goal!

179
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:25,240
Blue Lock team has turned the score around!

180
00:13:31,570 --> 00:13:32,850
Only one person.

181
00:13:33,090 --> 00:13:36,370
Only one person remained up front
in front of goal, number 11.

182
00:13:37,170 --> 00:13:40,980
Yoichi Isagi's direct shot
pierced the net.

183
00:13:54,030 --> 00:13:57,230
And the final whistle announces the end of the match.

184
00:13:58,270 --> 00:14:03,360
The result is four goals to three
in favor of Blue Lock 11.

185
00:14:23,140 --> 00:14:24,740
Hey genius.

186
00:14:25,420 --> 00:14:27,580
Why didn't you play the ball forward directly?

187
00:14:28,750 --> 00:14:31,430
If you had, we could have at least
avoided conceding the goal.

188
00:14:34,070 --> 00:14:35,390
With one minute remaining.

189
00:14:35,470 --> 00:14:37,870
Time would have run out if we'd exchanged passes.

190
00:14:38,510 --> 00:14:42,680
The through pass from me to you
was the best option for me.

191
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:46,880
He got there before you reached the goal.

192
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:49,010
That's all there is to it.

193
00:14:51,170 --> 00:14:55,130
So, since the little brother stopped you
because of the big brother's mistake,

194
00:14:55,210 --> 00:14:57,210
That means my goal counts, right?

195
00:14:58,330 --> 00:15:01,420
As we agreed, give me your number now.

196
00:15:04,140 --> 00:15:05,780
I'll give it to you after I shower first.

197
00:15:07,980 --> 00:15:10,350
That was a flashy finish, Isagi.

198
00:15:11,070 --> 00:15:12,350
Thank you.

199
00:15:13,150 --> 00:15:14,830
Great goal, hero.

200
00:15:15,310 --> 00:15:16,310
Aiku.

201
00:15:16,790 --> 00:15:19,070
Were you targeting
my blind spots all along?

202
00:15:19,790 --> 00:15:20,790
Yes.

203
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:24,320
Plus the point
from which I could score directly.

204
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:27,800
And also his obsession with beating Sae Itoshi.

205
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:32,130
I trusted that obsession,
and this was the fruit of my 90-minute effort.

206
00:15:34,170 --> 00:15:35,570
At that moment...

207
00:15:35,770 --> 00:15:39,490
I ran to the point where
these three conditions met at once.

208
00:15:40,690 --> 00:15:43,660
And the ball fell there by chance.

209
00:15:44,900 --> 00:15:47,420
You brought yourself luck, Yoichi Isagi.

210
00:15:50,340 --> 00:15:51,630
You defeated us.

211
00:15:52,910 --> 00:15:54,910
Congratulations, Blue Lock.

212
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:09,440
Rin.

213
00:16:13,090 --> 00:16:14,650
I was wrong.

214
00:16:15,210 --> 00:16:18,690
I used to think that Japan
would never produce a prominent forward.

215
00:16:19,290 --> 00:16:20,290
Brother!

216
00:16:21,380 --> 00:16:23,220
But the one who awakened your instincts...

217
00:16:23,620 --> 00:16:25,660
And who can change football
in this country is...

218
00:16:28,580 --> 00:16:29,780
Yoichi Isagi.

219
00:16:30,500 --> 00:16:32,510
That egoist might just be able to do it.

220
00:16:33,790 --> 00:16:34,790
What?

221
00:16:36,150 --> 00:16:38,910
This country can still change.

222
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:45,640
Isagi, they're calling for you.
They want you for a TV interview.

223
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:46,720
What?

224
00:16:47,280 --> 00:16:49,280
Come on, go now.

225
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:51,730
"The shocking final goal
from Blue Lock."

226
00:16:52,690 --> 00:16:56,370
With us now, the scorer of the decisive, exciting goal,
Blue Lock 11 player, Yoichi Isagi.

227
00:16:57,050 --> 00:16:59,730
How do you feel after the match?

228
00:17:00,490 --> 00:17:06,460
I feel very happy, yeah.

229
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:10,900
Thanks to your performance today, it seems you have a chance
to join the U-20 national team.

230
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:13,070
Do you have any aspirations from now on?

231
00:17:17,270 --> 00:17:18,590
From now on.

232
00:17:18,950 --> 00:17:20,110
Aspirations!

233
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:24,240
My future!

234
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:51,950
We'll win the championship.

235
00:17:52,190 --> 00:17:53,190
What?

236
00:17:54,270 --> 00:17:55,870
We, Blue Lock team...

237
00:17:56,510 --> 00:18:00,030
Will win the U-20 World Cup.

238
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:06,800
No, not that.

239
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:10,440
I will make Japan...

240
00:18:11,370 --> 00:18:14,410
Win the U-20 World Cup.

241
00:18:17,890 --> 00:18:25,140
"Blue Lock Project.
First stage completed."

242
00:18:31,910 --> 00:18:33,910
Thank you very much.

243
00:18:52,570 --> 00:18:55,450
Congratulations, you uncut diamonds.

244
00:18:56,570 --> 00:18:59,170
You have achieved something great.

245
00:18:59,770 --> 00:19:04,220
But this moment must not be
the peak of your football lives.

246
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:07,460
This victory is not the end of the battle.

247
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:09,780
It is the beginning of Blue Lock.

248
00:19:10,820 --> 00:19:14,550
I will extract the world's best forward from among you.

249
00:19:14,750 --> 00:19:16,430
This dream will not change.

250
00:19:17,270 --> 00:19:23,240
I will create the one hero who will lead Japan
to win the World Cup.

251
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:27,960
As for the rest, their lives will become utter chaos.

252
00:19:29,560 --> 00:19:33,170
Be ready, you uncut diamonds.

253
00:19:34,170 --> 00:19:39,170
We, Blue Lock, have reached a stage
from which we can no longer turn back.

254
00:19:42,420 --> 00:19:46,140
What terrible words.
Clarity of mind and spirit and dazzling elegance.

255
00:19:46,500 --> 00:19:48,860
Awesome, I've got goosebumps.

256
00:19:48,940 --> 00:19:50,940
- Yeah.
- Truly amazing!

257
00:19:51,670 --> 00:19:54,990
Alright, today we'll hold a luxurious feast.

258
00:19:55,190 --> 00:19:56,950
Everyone can enjoy it.
Let's celebrate together.

259
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:59,390
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

260
00:20:32,630 --> 00:20:36,670
"Blue Lock, Japan U-20 National Team.
Friendly Match."

261
00:21:40,490 --> 00:21:41,500
Rin.

262
00:21:42,580 --> 00:21:45,340
If you hadn't been there, I wouldn't have scored.

263
00:21:46,620 --> 00:21:47,940
At that moment...

264
00:21:48,060 --> 00:21:51,670
I was the only one who believed
you would beat Sae, and this is the result.

265
00:21:52,870 --> 00:21:55,830
