- Because I lost to you and learned the trick of luck...

266
00:21:56,870 --> 00:21:59,430
Today I was able to seize that chance.

267
00:22:00,830 --> 00:22:02,080
Thank you, Rin.

268
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:04,840
That goal was for both of us.

269
