278
00:22:37,470 --> 00:22:38,470
Try it.

279
00:22:43,080 --> 00:22:46,320
What do you all think of Blue Lock?

280
00:22:48,560 --> 00:22:50,200
"This is amazing."

281
00:22:50,280 --> 00:22:51,890
"The level of the players and the quality of the story are incredible."

282
00:22:51,970 --> 00:22:53,770
"We're optimistic."

283
00:22:54,170 --> 00:22:57,450
We're ready to ignite the world's passion.

284
00:22:58,090 --> 00:23:01,340
It now depends only on your approval.

285
00:23:08,500 --> 00:23:10,500
The greatest forward in the world.

286
00:23:10,940 --> 00:23:15,870
Suddenly appears in the most
heated place in football.

287
00:23:18,150 --> 00:23:21,160
Blue Lock Project, Phase Two.

288
00:23:23,240 --> 00:23:26,840
Here begins the Neo Egoist League.

289
00:23:29,640 --> 00:23:32,930
"Neo Egoist League.
Phase Two."

290
00:23:44,220 --> 00:23:46,220
